  "captions": [
    {
      "sequence_id": "observe-a",
      "role": "editorial",
      "start_seconds": 0.05,
      "end_seconds": 6.98,
      "text": "В КАКОЙ ЧАСТИ СЕБЯ",
      "font": "nikulinaCondensed",
      "size": 68,
      "weight": 700,
      "color": "#F7F4EF",
      "case": "upper",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -620,
      "animation": "fade-slide-up",
      "animation_duration_frames": 10,
      "slide_distance_px": 12,
      "fade_out_frames": 7
    },
    {
      "sequence_id": "observe-a",
      "role": "editorial",
      "start_seconds": 0.18,
      "end_seconds": 6.98,
      "text": "ТЫ РАССЫПАЕШЬСЯ?",
      "font": "nikulinaCondensed",
      "size": 76,
      "weight": 700,
      "color": "#F7F4EF",
      "case": "upper",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -498,
      "animation": "fade-slide-up",
      "animation_duration_frames": 10,
      "slide_distance_px": 12,
      "fade_out_frames": 7
    },
    {
      "sequence_id": "observe-a",
      "role": "speech",
      "phrase_id": "observe-a-g1",
      "start_seconds": 0,
      "end_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "Первым этапом изучите свои эго-личности.",
      "font": "nikulinaSans",
      "size": 56,
      "weight": 600,
      "color": "#F7F4EF",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520,
      "shadow": [
        {
          "y": 3,
          "blur": 18,
          "color": "rgba(0,0,0,0.76)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sequence_id": "observe-a",
      "role": "speech",
      "phrase_id": "observe-a-g2",
      "start_seconds": 2.84,
      "end_seconds": 6.98,
      "text": "Потом вы сможете понять, в какой части себя вы рассыпаетесь.",
      "font": "nikulinaSans",
      "size": 56,
      "weight": 600,
      "color": "#F7F4EF",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520,
      "shadow": [
        {
          "y": 3,
          "blur": 18,
          "color": "rgba(0,0,0,0.76)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sequence_id": "observe-b",
      "role": "speech",
      "phrase_id": "observe-b-g1",
      "start_seconds": 0,
      "end_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "Вы наблю... вы изучаете себя, как вы разговариваете с людьми.",
      "font": "nikulinaSans",
      "size": 56,
      "weight": 600,
      "color": "#F7F4EF",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520,
      "shadow": [
        {
          "y": 3,
          "blur": 18,
          "color": "rgba(0,0,0,0.76)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sequence_id": "observe-b",
      "role": "speech",
      "phrase_id": "observe-b-g2",
      "start_seconds": 4.82,
      "end_seconds": 7.18,
      "text": "Вам нужно уйти в глубокую саморефлексию.",
      "font": "nikulinaSans",
      "size": 56,
      "weight": 600,
      "color": "#F7F4EF",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520,
      "shadow": [
        {
          "y": 3,
          "blur": 18,
          "color": "rgba(0,0,0,0.76)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sequence_id": "protective-a",
      "role": "speech",
      "phrase_id": "protective-a-g1",
      "start_seconds": 0,
      "end_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "То есть эти защитные формы защищают обычно ребенка травмированного.",
      "font": "nikulinaSans",
      "size": 56,
      "weight": 600,
      "color": "#F7F4EF",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520,
      "shadow": [
        {
          "y": 3,
          "blur": 18,
          "color": "rgba(0,0,0,0.76)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sequence_id": "protective-a",
      "role": "speech",
      "phrase_id": "protective-a-g2",
      "start_seconds": 4.94,
      "end_seconds": 9.8,
      "text": "Вот они происходят в расщеплении психики, в ранней травме детства.",
      "font": "nikulinaSans",
      "size": 56,
      "weight": 600,
      "color": "#F7F4EF",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520,
      "shadow": [
        {
          "y": 3,
          "blur": 18,
          "color": "rgba(0,0,0,0.76)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sequence_id": "protective-a",
      "role": "speech",
      "phrase_id": "protective-a-g3",
      "start_seconds": 10.26,
      "end_seconds": 16.42,
      "text": "То есть когда происходит какая-то невыносимая история в детстве для ребенка, у него начинает расщепляться психика на много",
      "font": "nikulinaSans",
      "size": 56,
      "weight": 600,
      "color": "#F7F4EF",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520,
      "shadow": [
        {
          "y": 3,
          "blur": 18,
          "color": "rgba(0,0,0,0.76)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sequence_id": "protective-a",
      "role": "speech",
      "phrase_id": "protective-a-g4",
      "start_seconds": 16.42,
      "end_seconds": 17.34,
      "text": "эго-личностей.",
      "font": "nikulinaSans",
      "size": 56,
      "weight": 600,
      "color": "#F7F4EF",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520,
      "shadow": [
        {
          "y": 3,
          "blur": 18,
          "color": "rgba(0,0,0,0.76)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sequence_id": "protective-b",
      "role": "speech",
      "phrase_id": "protective-b-g1",
      "start_seconds": 0.12,
      "end_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Вот смотри, 12 архетипов лучше не привязываться.",
      "font": "nikulinaSans",
      "size": 56,
      "weight": 600,
      "color": "#F7F4EF",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520,
      "shadow": [
        {
          "y": 3,
          "blur": 18,
          "color": "rgba(0,0,0,0.76)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sequence_id": "protective-b",
      "role": "speech",
      "phrase_id": "protective-b-g2",
      "start_seconds": 3.84,
      "end_seconds": 10.16,
      "text": "Мы взяли и изучили себя отдельно от всех архетипов, мы назвали себя своими именами.",
      "font": "nikulinaSans",
      "size": 56,
      "weight": 600,
      "color": "#F7F4EF",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520,
      "shadow": [
        {
          "y": 3,
          "blur": 18,
          "color": "rgba(0,0,0,0.76)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sequence_id": "protective-b",
      "role": "editorial",
      "start_seconds": 6.36,
      "end_seconds": 10.16,
      "text": "НАЗОВИ СВОИ ЧАСТИ",
      "font": "nikulinaCondensed",
      "size": 66,
      "weight": 700,
      "color": "#F7F4EF",
      "case": "upper",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -500,
      "animation": "fade-slide-up",
      "animation_duration_frames": 10,
